  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "じんるいを　かんしする　ＵＦＯだとオカルトざっしが　しょうかいしたみちの　ぶったいに　にている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "인류를 감시하기 위한 UFO라며 오컬트 잡지에서 소개된 적 있는 미지의 물체와 닮았다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "與超自然雜誌裡以監視人類的ＵＦＯ來介紹的未知物體長得很相似。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il ressemble à une entité étrange décrite dans une revue sur les phénomènes paranormaux. D’après celle-ci, ce serait un ovni qui épie la race humaine.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ähnelt einem unbekannten Objekt, das einer esoterischen Zeitschrift nach ein zur Beobachtung der Menschheit entsandtes UFO sein soll.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se asemeja a un extraño objeto descrito en una revista esotérica como \"un ovni enviado con el objetivo de espiar a la raza humana\".",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ricorda molto un oscuro oggetto descritto in una rivista di paranormale come un ufo inviato qui per spiare le attività umane.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon resembles an unknown object described in a paranormal magazine as a UFO sent to observe humanity.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "人類を　監視する　ＵＦＯだとオカルト雑誌が　紹介した未知の　物体に　似ている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "与超自然杂志中所介绍的监视人类的ＵＦＯ这种未知物体很相似。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se asemeja a un extraño objeto descrito en una revista esotérica como \"un ovni enviado con el objetivo de espiar a la raza humana\".",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ほかくれいは　ゼロ。　データぶそく。ふるい　しょもつに　しるされた　ぶったいととくちょうが　いっち。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "포획된 사례는 없으며 데이터도 부족하다. 오래된 서적에 기록된 물체와 특징이 일치한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "無捕獲紀錄。資料不足。其特徵與古書裡所記載的物體一致。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ses attributs correspondent à ceux d’une entité évoquée dans un livre ancien. On manque de données sur lui, car nul n’en a jamais attrapé.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Da es noch nie gefangen wurde, ist die Datenlage dürftig. Seine Merkmale decken sich mit einem Objekt, das in einer alten Schrift erwähnt wurde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nunca se había capturado uno, ergo los datos son escasos. Su descripción coincide con la de un objeto mencionado en unos viejos escritos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mancano dati su questo Pokémon, mai catturato in passato. Le sue caratteristiche coincidono con quelle di un oggetto descritto in un antico testo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "No records exist of this species being caught. Data is lacking, but the Pokémon’s traits match up with an object described in an old book.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "捕獲例は　ゼロ。　データ不足。古い　書物に　記された　物体と特徴が　一致。",
      "language": {
